<title>AUSTRIA: Austria received two Creditanstalt offers - radio.</title>
<headline>Austria received two Creditanstalt offers - radio.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's finance ministry has received two indicative offers for privatisation candidate Creditanstalt, Austrian state radio said on Monday.</p>
<p>Nobody at the ministry was immediately able to confirm the report.</p>
</text>
